   "race": "Windshaper Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "<Constable Aonda wears an intense look on her face, clearly deep in thought.>",
   "time": 1793849636,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Zephras Isle"
  },
  "251523|191d4b60": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Warrior",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 2521,
   "name": "Constable Aonda",
   "npc": "251523",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Windshaper Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "More than I'd like, I'm afraid. We've been harassed by a group of bandits camping out in a cave to the north, and the Al'Aketh cult recently took over Falaath Village to the south of us. I trust every peacekeeper and citizen here, but we are far too few to keep the village secure. \r\n\r\nIf the cult decides to continue their expansion here, there's little we can do to stop them.",
   "time": 1793849371,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Zephras Isle"
  },
  "251902|f56638d6": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Warrior",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 2521,
   "name": "Illaya Amberwind",
   "npc": "251902",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Windshaper Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Greetings, child. I am Illaya Amberwind and I am the Elder Windshaper here on Zephras Isle. It's always nice to meet young new faces that make their way down from the grove.\r\n\r\nDon't let this old shaman hold you up, no doubt you've got many adventures to see to. Do feel free to stop by later if you'd like.",
   "time": 1793849592,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Zephras Isle"
  },
  "251905|3541aa81": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Warrior",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 2521,
   "name": "Zerril Softbreeze",
   "npc": "251905",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Windshaper Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "If you need training as a cook, I have a few tips and tricks I could pass on! Ho ho! Throw on an apron and let's get started!",
   "time": 1793848904,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Zephras Isle"
  },
  "251906|6574e2ad": {
   "build": "70790",
