   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 2521,
   "name": "Messana Crestwind",
   "npc": "257022",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Windshaper Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "You might think that just because we live on a floating island, there would be no need for miners like me. After so many thousands of years, however, we still manage to dig up a lot of interesting things.\r\n\r\nIt's almost like there's some invisible force, constantly creating new mineral deposits every so often. That's magic for you though, right?\r\n\r\nRegardless, if you need training as a miner, then I'm your shen'dorei.",
   "time": 1793849164,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Zephras Isle"
  },
